    {
      "id": "claim_440956a27c064434bfef6a73d173e6b3",
      "statement": "The worker needs both DATABASE_URL and DIRECT_URL because its Prisma datasource declares url = env(\"DATABASE_URL\") and directUrl = env(\"DIRECT_URL\"); both compose files inject both variables explicitly and gate the container on postgres being service_healthy, while the GitHub workflow supplies DATABASE_URL, DIRECT_URL and ALERT_WEBHOOK_URL from secrets. ALERT_WEBHOOK_URL is the only optional variable: both compositions pass it through as ${ALERT_WEBHOOK_URL:-}, i.e. an empty string when unset, which sendAlert() treats as falsy and returns on immediately, so an unset webhook produces a completely silent run.",
