    {
      "id": "claim_eb273ecf709648ae8796988bb47dd93d",
      "statement": "Every SyncMetadata row carries a rulesetVersionId generated by generateRulesetVersionId() as `11.1.0-YYYY-QN-MFM` from the run's wall clock (quarter derived from the current month), not from any Wahapedia data; the API's GET /api/changelog surfaces this value as currentRulesetVersion.",
