      "statement": "sendAlert() POSTs the run summary as { content: fenced text } JSON (Discord/Slack webhook shape), returns immediately when ALERT_WEBHOOK_URL is unset, and swallows its own delivery errors; runETLPipeline calls it only when updated > 0 or errors > 0, so an all-NO_DELTA run produces no notification.",
